and a generating set for the ideal as input. By default the enumeration is done
memoryless reverse search. If the ideal is symmetric the symmetry option is use
will be done up to symmetry using a breadth first search. The program needs a s
basis to do its computations. If the -g option is not specified it will compute
Buchberger's algorithm.
